0..73 Comment "//! Shared access. `access shared c as w { … }` lends a held value to a"
74..152 Comment "//! read-only view: the body reads `w` and `c` alike, nothing is written back,"
153..225 Comment "//! and the view ends with its body, so it takes no `resume`, `abort` or"
226..299 Comment "//! `unwind`. The value is frozen for the body: shared views nest, and an"
300..380 Comment "//! exclusive access waits until they end. The loan follows Rust\'s shared borrow"
381..423 Comment "//! [Rust-reference], § Borrow operators."
424..427 Comment "//!"
428..457 Comment "//! - cites: [Rust-reference]"
